COPY public.waste_routes (cat, material, factor_domain, factor_key, route, facility_id, is_recovered, carbon_basis, show_as, notes) FROM stdin;
A	Plastics	waste	plastics	recycled	ASIARECY	t	fossil	own	Recycled by Asia Recycling. Fossil carbon - counts in full under NEA/IPCC.
B	Food waste	waste	food	incineration	TSIP	f	biogenic	own	NEA: biogenic CO2 reported as a SEPARATE line item, not in the fossil total.
C	Domestic waste	waste	paper_cardboard	incineration	TSIP	f	biogenic	own	Represented by paper/cardboard. Largely biogenic - separate line under NEA.
D	Cooking oil	\N	\N	recycled	GREENTEC	t	n/a	own	Collected by GreenTec for recycling. Not incinerated.
E	Incinerator ashes	waste	metal	landfill	TMTS	f	inert	own	Already combusted on board. TMTS then Semakau.
F	Operational waste	waste	other	incineration	TSIP	f	mixed	own	SEFR Other waste factor.
I	E-waste	\N	\N	recycled	\N	t	n/a	other	MARPOL Cat I. Tracked fully in backend; DISPLAYED AS OTHERS on the client dashboard.
OTHER	Other (from Remarks)	\N	\N	unknown	\N	f	unknown	other	Catch-all for any stream written in the DO Remarks column with no category of its own, e.g. oily rags. Description held in collections.other_desc; DISPLAYED AS OTHERS on the dashboard.
LAND_WOOD	Wood	\N	\N	Recycled	\N	t	biogenic	own	Michelle 13 Aug 2026: wood recycled (route-confirmed). Receiving facility not yet named. STE land stream.
LAND_CONCRETE	Concrete / Stone	\N	\N	Recycled	\N	t	inert	own	Michelle 14 Aug 2026: concrete stone recycled (route-confirmed). Receiving facility not yet named. STE land stream.
LAND_FENDER	Fenders (rubber)	\N	\N	Recycled	\N	t	fossil	own	Michelle 14 Aug 2026: fenders recycled (route-confirmed). Receiving facility not yet named. STE land stream.
LAND_TYRE	Tyres	\N	\N	Recycled	\N	t	fossil	own	Michelle 14 Aug 2026: tyres recycled (route-confirmed). Receiving facility not yet named. STE land stream.
LAND_GENERAL	General Waste	\N	\N	Disposal	\N	f	mixed	own	Michelle 14 Aug 2026: general waste NOT recycled (disposed). STE land stream.
LAND_PAINT	Old Paint	\N	\N	Disposal	\N	f	fossil	own	Michelle 14 Aug 2026: old paint NOT recycled (disposed). STE land stream.
LAND_MISC	Misc / Other	\N	\N	Disposal	\N	f	mixed	own	Michelle 14 Aug 2026: misc NOT recycled (disposed). STE land stream (e.g. electrode stud ends, NDT chemical cans). OTC still pending.
